Z||000000||turbo86se||07-02-2000||08:43 PM||||hey guys!!<BR>I'm in the process of installing a Formula V6 in my 88 coupe, like the manifolds on my 86SE, I would like to have the manifolds ported and polished. I had the manifolds p & p by Fiero Performance (I think) in Allentown, PA many years ago, and they did a great job. Since I don't know how to get in touch with them, can any of ya'll do this for me? I'm taking them off the engine tomorrow. <BR>Thanks!!!||||reg||5
Z||000001||Taijiguy||07-02-2000||10:32 PM||||I mentioned this in another topic, but there's a place that has a really unique method of porting and polishing- they pump an abrasive paste through the ports, which smooths and opens the castings. The coolest part of this is that since it's a fluid that does the work, it would tend to follow the path that would be travelled by air as it enters the chambers, so you end up with a highly effective job. I can't remember the name of the place offhand, but they're on the 'net.<BR>Good luck, if you get jammed up, let me know, I can do 'em for you.<P>Taiji<P>modified 85 GT||||reg||1
Z||000002||Oreif||07-02-2000||11:52 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ng_dancer1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/ng_dancer1/</A> <P>The above link does porting and polishing on all GM 60 degree V-6's||||reg||3
Z||000003||turbo86se||07-03-2000||12:25 AM||||thanks oreif and taijiguy!!  I appreciate the help. Taijiguy I'm sending you an email!!||||reg||1
Z||000004||HYPTNOTiSE||07-03-2000||01:15 AM||||The process is call extrude honing, and would totally be worthless for stock manifolds. It's way to expensive of a process and works well mostly on cast parts. Just get in there with a die grinder and start cutting the obstructions out. I thought about offering this as a service to other Fiero owners, but as a whole Fiero owners are cheap and this process is very labor intensive.  Best bet is to do it yourself and have someone re-weld the flanges.  <P>------------------<BR>Mike LeCompte<BR>86 Fiero GT 3.2L w/ nitrous||||reg||1
